      "id": 19002,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-05T20:00:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>An on time State of GTG post! Unprecedented in 2019! Things are going very well as we gear up for the summer/fall convention and release season. We've also ironed out a number of internal processes that will really help us going forward. Here's some stuff we did:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Funded and concluded the Kickstarter for the Sentinel Comics RPG!</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Seriously, we unlocked so many books! Wow!</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Created a production schedule for the next three years; that's right, we know roughly what we'll be working on every month through 2021.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Commissioned writing for all of the unlocked SC:RPG books.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Moved most of the core SC:RPG rulebook chapters into final editing.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Met with the creators of Medium, a very fun party game we'll be publishing this year.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Commissioned a ton of Jagged Earth art and began layout on the bulk of the expansion.</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Organized our warehouse and got caught up on freight orders for the first time since May.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Here is the status of all of our works in progress.</p>\n<p><strong>In Stock Since mid-January</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n<em>Bottom of the 9th</em>&nbsp;reprint</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">\n<em>Spirit Island</em>&nbsp;(7th printing)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">\n<em>Spirit Island: Branch &amp; Claw</em>&nbsp;reprint</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">\n<em>SotM: Omnitron-IV</em> reprint</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Shipping to Backers</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Nothing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>In Transit; On a Boat</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">\n<em>Villains of the Multiverse</em>&nbsp;reprint</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">\n<em>Spirit Island: Promo Spirit Pack 1</em>&nbsp;reprint</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>At Factory; Pre-Press Work</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\"><em>Legends of Sleepy Hollow</em></li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\"><em>Homebrewers</em></li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\"><em>Microbrewers</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Current WIP Focus by GTG</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Sentinel Comics: The Role Playing Game core rulebook (Christopher, Jenn, Critical Hits)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Prime War (Christopher, Chris Burton, Lore Forge)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Spirit Island: The Jagged Earth (Paul, Christopher, Jenn, Erik)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Sentinels of Freedom video game (Christopher, Adam, Underbite Studio)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">The History of Sentinel Comics (Christopher, Adam)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Medium (Jenn, Chris Burton, Christopher)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Untitled Cheapass Games Project (Jenn, Chris Burton, James Ernest)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Milkman (Chris Kirkman, Chris Burton)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Fate of the Elder Gods: Agents of Arkham (Chris Kirkman)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">Some other games (Chris Kirkman, Chris Burton)</li>\n\t<li data-userway-font-size=\"14\">A new and improved website (Jenn, Paul, Alex, Joel)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I'll see you next month!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:32.382Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
