      "created_at": "2019-03-18T19:45:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ugh, I had been waiting for the SI Errata Pack and never noticed that it had become available (and promptly disappeared, apparently).&nbsp; I definitely have a 4th/5th edition printing, which I didn't noticed until I tried a game with \"Shadow's Flicker Like Flame.\"&nbsp; Looks like Dissolve the Bonds of Kinship is the only substantial error, though.</p>",
