      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Paul\"]\n\n@dpt\n\nNo, that will not be back in stock at the same time. We may have it available again in the summer, but we have already sold as many copies of the errata pack as we sold of editions of the game that require it, so some people definitely picked it up unnecessarilly.\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&nbsp;suspect&nbsp;that may be in large part because 6th printing says \"5th printing\" on the back - I'd be very surprised if there weren't a fair number of people who ordered it in good faith but didn't actually need it.\n",
